Florist oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-24. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
The order number step of EnterFloristOrderForm moves into AdvanceFlowerOrderNumberOnEntry, the price computation of
DisplayFlowerDynamicItems into CalcFlowerOrderPrice and the body of BtnFlowerOrderSendButtonCallback into SendFlowerOrder
(same code, same call sites). Appends OracleFlowerOrder (the form's selection: flower, destination, the six check boxes;
opens the gallery text when no florist page did), OracleFlowerOrderFormEntered, OracleFlowerOrderPrice and
OracleFlowerOrderSend. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0024.

